## Explicit Memory Context
Storage happens only when the agent **calls the update_memory tool**. Trigger query: "I'd like to prepare for my annual physical. I'm 52, with type 2 diabetes (apixaban 5mg twice daily and metoprolol 25mg), GERD (metoprolol 25mg), and a..."

